      "message": "For commit titles, try to address both _what_ and _why_ the commit is changing the code. In this case, the \"meaty bit\" isn\u0027t that we\u0027re duplicating the image but that we\u0027re introducing a test that runs the image with the newly-introduced capability e.g.\n```\nMicrodroidHostTests: Add testMicrodroidBootsWithEFI\n```\nAlso, try to keep lines in the commit message body under 72 characters. Ideally, this should be caught by your IDE?",
